What is printed by the following program?
```java
class Account {
    int balance = 100;
    void deposit(int amt) {
        balance += amt;
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Account a1 = new Account();
        Account a2 = a1;
        a2.deposit(50);
        System.out.println(a1.balance + " " + a2.balance);
    }
}
```

