What does the following program print?
```java
class Node {
    int val;
    Node next;
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Node n1 = new Node();
        n1.val = 1;
        n1.next = new Node();
        n1.next.val = 2;
        System.out.println(n1.val + " " + n1.next.val);
    }
}
